# FabricJS Coordinate System Test

A test for object positioning relative to parent objects,
examining originX, originY, relative positioning within groups,
and the effects of strokeWidth.

## Installation

- `nvm install v22`
- `npm install`
- `npm run build`

## Run Test

- `npm run start`

The result is dumpped to directory.

- `stroke.json`, `stroke.svg`, `stroke.png`
- `origin.json`, `origin.svg`, `origin.png`

## Summary of Stroke Result 

This result is based on FabricJS 5.5.2

![Stroke Test](stroke.svg)

